__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The BEAM writes this where it dies; the trope gate runs elixir.
erl_crash.dump


# The fourloops layers live in apparatus/1143-keypoints-to-anny/, the first loop. default.xml links them to this root
# and into each of the four RFDs that scope them, so every Scope naming the bare filename
# resolves beside its own document. The links are not committed as second copies.
/fourloops-plan.usda
/fourloops-etnf.usda
rfd/114[4-6]-*/fourloops-plan.usda
rfd/114[4-6]-*/fourloops-etnf.usda
/_build/
/deps/
/priv/corpus.bin

# RFD 2232: README.md, DETAILS.md and the serial registers are rendered from the
# .exs sources by `mix rfd.render`; the sources are what is tracked. Nothing else
# belongs under rfd/NNNN-slug/ -- apparatus lives in apparatus/NNNN-slug/, and
# check_rfd_dirs_rendered_only.py fails a tracked file that lands there.
rfd/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-*/README.md
rfd/[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]-*/DETAILS.md
/SERIALS.usda
/SERIALS-*.usda
